# Meta Muse / Quantumult X remote filter
# Source: official Meta Muse service and verified public AI rule collections.
# No force-policy override: QX automatically creates the Muse policy group if missing.
# After the group appears, add or select your preferred US proxy node in the Muse group.
# Note: Meta account / Graph hosts are shared with other Meta services.
host-suffix, muse.ai, Muse
host-suffix, metaaivm.com, Muse
host-suffix, meta.ai, Muse
host-suffix, metaaiusercontent.com, Muse
host, auth.meta.com, Muse
host, accountscenter.meta.com, Muse
host, meta.graph.meta.com, Muse
host, ar.graph.meta.com, Muse
